# Line-ending discipline.
#
# Windows clones (where core.autocrlf may default to true) would
# otherwise convert text files to CRLF. The Rust toolchain and the
# shell scripts under scripts/ both reject stray \r characters, and a
# CRLF .spm golden fixture would silently fail its byte-for-byte
# comparison. Pin every text format to LF and mark binaries explicitly.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.rs      text eol=lf
*.toml    text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.txt     text eol=lf
justfile  text eol=lf

# Binary formats git must never transform. .spm files are physical
# execution layouts pinned byte for byte by golden tests.
*.spm     binary
*.bin     binary
*.png     binary
*.fs      binary
